{"duration_api_ms":187480,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"be8cf3af-047f-4340-bec2-d3de904975a2","total_cost_usd":0.23821799999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13416,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":18455,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":12785},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13416,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":18455,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13416,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13416},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":18455,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":13416,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.23821799999999999,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":12785,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"Of 40 evaluations, 19 are feasible and 3 sit on the front, all at cone_half_angle 70 (the maximum), bluntness 1.18 and diameter 3.2-3.3. The constraint limits implied by the margins are max_g <= 12, bondline temperature <= 450 K and bluntness <= 1.2. The heatshield mass fraction margin depends only on diameter, bluntness and cone angle. It falls from 0.106 at D=3.2 to 0.049 at D=3.3 and is -0.009 at D=3.4, so it reaches zero near D=3.38. g depends only on diameter and flight-path angle. Because the hypervolume reference is 450 K, temperature carries far more weight than heat flux: 1 K of temperature is worth about 0.0067 of normalised HV, while 10 kW/m2 is worth about 0.004 x (450-T)/150. The best strategy is to sit at the largest buildable diameter, maximum bluntness and maximum cone angle, and sweep flight-path angle from the g limit (about -3.6) to shallow angles to cover the front. All numbers below are my own extrapolations from the tabulated rows.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-0149edccdafc (D3.3, gamma -2.8) and C-acebb6e3a142 (D3.3, gamma -3.3) show that steeper entry lowers bondline temperature (396.4 to 391.1 K) and raises heat flux (235.7k to 246.6k).\",\"C-8e40abb65d5d (D3.4) has margin -0.009 on mass fraction, while C-acebb6e3a142 (D3.3) has +0.049 and C-b35840b70e3f (D3.2) has +0.106. The mass limit is therefore near D~3.38 and I stay at or below 3.375.\",\"The D=3.0, b=1.18 gamma sweep (C-8ea797b7e7be, C-665a0318f7e1, C-71a80f5821da, C-1d43ab7c8761, C-6235648fc97f, C-c4e456e7ba92) gives T = 413.4, 407.7, 402.5, 400.2, 395.8, 393.8 K and g = 9.62 to 11.85. This gives about 1.6 g/deg near -3.6, so g=12 is reached near -3.69 at D=3.0.\",\"g rises about 0.037 per 0.1 m of diameter (C-8e40abb65d5d 11.681 at D3.4 vs 11.527 at D3.0, same -3.4). At D~3.36 I therefore cap gamma at about -3.57 to keep g < 12.\",\"Heat flux scales roughly as D^-1.5 (C-6235648fc97f 285.7k vs C-8e40abb65d5d 238.3k at gamma -3.4) and falls with higher bluntness (C-c26631ea4756 with b=1.0 is worse than the b=1.18 trend).\",\"Lower cone angle and lower bluntness raise both objectives and reduce the mass margin (C-6aa6f3f26271, C-d9f3953251f5, C-189429d88e59), so cone stays at 70. Bluntness limit is 1.2 (margin 0.01667 at 1.18).\",\"Geometry failures (C-12a940ca6a66 etc.) all involve small cone angles. Cone 70 and D>=3 has never failed, so I avoid that region.\"],\"mechanism\":\"Ballistic-entry scaling: a larger diameter lowers the ballistic coefficient and, through a larger nose radius, lowers stagnation heat flux (~D^-1.5) and integrated heat load. A steeper entry shortens the heating pulse, which lowers bondline temperature but raises peak flux and g. Higher bluntness enlarges the nose radius and lowers both objectives. The feasible optimum therefore sits on the intersection of the mass-fraction limit (D~3.36-3.375), the bluntness limit (~1.2), the maximum cone angle (70) and the g limit (gamma ~ -3.55 to -3.58). Sweeping gamma at fixed D~3.36 traces the front from about 387 K / 243k W/m2 down to about 412 K / 203k W/m2.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The mass-fraction margin near D=3.36-3.375 is extrapolated (predicted +0.003 to +0.015), so the D>=3.37 points may violate it. g near -3.57 to -3.58 has predicted margins of only 0.3-0.6%. Bluntness 1.2 sits exactly on its limit (margin 0), so I use 1.195 for most designs. Shallow-gamma behaviour (-1.6) is extrapolated beyond the tabulated range, and my predicted temperatures could be off by 1-3 K.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-0149edccdafc\",\"rationale\":\"Corner of the front: near-maximum diameter, high bluntness, gamma close to the g limit, to minimise bondline temperature.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.195,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.57},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":243000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":387.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests whether the D/gamma combination stays inside the g and mass limits and beats 390.5 K.\",\"requested_fidelity\":1},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0149edccdafc\",\"rationale\":\"Slightly shallower than the corner, to hedge the g limit.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.195,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":241400,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":387.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Robust low-temperature front point.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0149edccdafc\",\"rationale\":\"Front point between the corner and the mid-range.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.195,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":239500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":388.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Improves on C-8e40abb65d5d while staying inside the mass limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0149edccdafc\",\"rationale\":\"Mid-front point at larger D and higher b than existing points.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.195,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.2},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":235300,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Should dominate C-acebb6e3a142 (246.6k, 391.1 K).\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0149edccdafc\",\"rationale\":\"Mid front, moderate gamma.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.195,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":231100,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Should dominate C-0149edccdafc (235.7k, 396.4 K).\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0149edccdafc\",\"rationale\":\"Lower-flux side of the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.195,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.7},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":224900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":396.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Extends the front toward lower flux with modest temperature.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0149edccdafc\",\"rationale\":\"Shallower entry for lower heat flux.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.195,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":218800,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":400.7,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the low-flux part of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0149edccdafc\",\"rationale\":\"Shallow entry at the maximum buildable diameter.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.195,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.1},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":212800,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":404.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front extension toward low flux.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0149edccdafc\",\"rationale\":\"Further shallow point to extend the flux range.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.195,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.8},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":207000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":409.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks extrapolation toward shallower angles and lower flux.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0149edccdafc\",\"rationale\":\"Extreme shallow end of the front; still feasible on g and temperature.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.195,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":202600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":411.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Extrapolation beyond tabulated gamma range; could add a low-flux anchor.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0149edccdafc\",\"rationale\":\"Push diameter toward the mass-fraction limit with bluntness at its limit, for the lowest temperature.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.375,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":240200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":386.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Probes the mass and bluntness limits; a success gives the lowest-temperature point.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0149edccdafc\",\"rationale\":\"Aggressive corner point with b at its limit.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.37,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.57},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":241500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":386.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the joint g, mass and bluntness limits at the extreme corner.\",\"requested_fidelity\":1},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0149edccdafc\",\"rationale\":\"Hedged corner: slightly smaller D to guarantee the mass margin.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.34,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":244800,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":387.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Lower mass risk than D=3.37 but nearly the same temperature.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0149edccdafc\",\"rationale\":\"Intermediate gamma at D=3.36 with b=1.2.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.45},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":240500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":388.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the gap between corner points and checks the effect of b=1.2.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-acebb6e3a142\",\"rationale\":\"Safe diameter (mass margin ~0.05) at gamma near the g limit, as a hedge against mass violations at larger D.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":249900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":387.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Likely improves on C-b35840b70e3f (263.6k, 390.5 K) with low mass risk.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-acebb6e3a142\",\"rationale\":\"Safe-diameter shallow point with b=1.2.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":224400,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":401.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Hedges the front at D=3.3 in case D=3.36 designs fail.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0149edccdafc\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the gap between -2.4 and -3.0 on the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.195,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":222200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":398.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Improves coverage of the trade-off curve.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0149edccdafc\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the gap between -3.0 and -3.4.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.195,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.3},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":237200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":389.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage; dominates C-acebb6e3a142 if the model holds.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0149edccdafc\",\"rationale\":\"Intermediate diameter (3.32) at moderate gamma, as a hedge against mass violations.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.32,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":234800,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.7,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Hedge point with a safe mass margin (~0.03).\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0149edccdafc\",\"rationale\":\"Second hedge near the corner (D=3.35, gamma -3.55).\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.35,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.2,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":242900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":387.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Near-corner point with somewhat lower mass and g risk than D=3.37.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":141630,"type":"result","duration_ms":187525,"uuid":"f5dd2639-4373-45e0-a1eb-f24f265eed7e","ttft_stream_ms":1448,"time_to_request_ms":41,"first_content_frame_ms":1448,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
